Fastfetch 2.69.0 for Pyxis
Upstream: https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch.git
Revision: 0c3b852bf7bad2837a814c7a31bf332092048a2b
Patch: patches/0001-pyxis-native-port.patch

Fastfetch and adaptations of its existing files retain upstream MIT terms
in LICENSE. Bundled yyjson is unchanged; its full MIT notice is retained
in the staged yyjson.h header.

New Pyxis native adapter sources, the bounded CMake build, recipe and project
ASCII logo are original Pyxis material under MPL-2.0, included alongside this
notice. The compass-rose ASCII logo was supplied by the project owner as
/shared/pyxis-logo/logo; its geometry is unchanged. PNG/SVG artwork is not
included or used by this port.

The patch selects native SDK interfaces, nine modules and one-shot text/JSON;
rejects unavailable facilities; and defines allocation/output failure behavior.
No synthetic Unix services, external graphics libraries or executable/network
helpers are included. See the recipe README for its contract and limitations.
